trong></h3><p>Ensure your double-page spreads start on even page numbers. Double-page spreads and covers should be submitted as single pages to maintain order and clarity during the printing process.</p>		\n													<img width=\"790\" height=\"826\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-115042.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-115042.webp 790w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-115042-287x300.webp 287w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-115042-768x803.webp 768w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-115042-600x627.webp 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 790px) 100vw, 790px\" />													\n		<h3><strong>Label and share your individual files properly.</strong></h3><p>We currently accept PDFs and JPGs. PDFs can be submitted as single files or combined. If combined, ensure they are in the proper order from cover to back. High-quality files ensure the best print results.<br /><br />If you are not submitting a combined PDF in proper order (from cover to back), then you need to:<br />1. Label each single page PDF or JPG properly. We recommend (Comic Book Title_Page #). <br />2. Combine all files into one folder<br />3. Compress or Zip the folder if needed.<br />4. Upload it  using a file transfer site such as Dropbox, WeTransfer, or Google Drive. <br />5. Share the link to your uploaded files. Be sure the link settings allow anyone with the link to view.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q7inJr71RIs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here for a helpful video.</a></p>		\n													<img width=\"942\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-115044.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-115044.webp 942w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-115044-300x229.webp 300w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-115044-768x587.webp 768w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-115044-600x459.webp 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 942px) 100vw, 942px\" />													\n		<h2><strong>Ensure you have the correct page count.</strong></h2><p>Saddle-stitch comics should have a page count in multiples of 4, and perfect-bound books should have a page count in multiples of 2. This ensures the structural integrity and proper binding of your book.</p>		\n													<img width=\"998\" height=\"1022\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-115046.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-115046.webp 998w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-115046-293x300.webp 293w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-115046-768x786.webp 768w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-115046-600x614.webp 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 998px) 100vw, 998px\" />													\n			<h2>The Printing Comics Spine Width Calculator</h2>		\n		Getting the spine width right on your perfect bound book can be tricky. But it doesn\'t have to be—with our Spine Width Calculator, simply enter your book\'s specs, and we\'ll deliver precise spine and cover measurements instantly, bleed included. It\'s bookbinding made easy.		\n			<h2>Rep us in your book and save.</h2>		\n		<p>Place our advertisement in your book and receive a discount on your books. You\'ll just need to leave a full page open for our full page Printing Comics ad.</p>		\n			<a href=\"#\">\n									DOWNLOAD\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"811\" height=\"924\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/group-of-cws-ads.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/group-of-cws-ads.webp 811w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/group-of-cws-ads-263x300.webp 263w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/group-of-cws-ads-768x875.webp 768w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/group-of-cws-ads-600x684.webp 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 811px) 100vw, 811px\" />','File Prep','','inherit','closed','closed','','17743-revision-v1','','','2024-08-28 11:03:17','2024-08-28 11:03:17','',17743,'https://mhc.lxf.temporary.site/website_b3635980/?p=17779',0,'revision','',0),(17782,2,'2024-08-29 11:16:49','2024-08-29 11:16:49','You\'ve worked hard on every detail of your comic books and other cool collectibles, like trading cards and stickers. That\'s why it\'s important that you know how your final product will FEEL in the hands of your readers and fans. The paperweight, the texture, the finish, and the shine; it all matters. With this epic sample pack, you\'ll get a variety of pre-printed materials so you can make an informed decision on how you want your creations to turn out.\r\n\r\nEach sample pack is shipped in our very own <strong>comic book sleeve</strong> and <strong>Printing Comics Mailer Boxes</strong>, and consists of:\r\n\r\n<address><strong>&gt; Full Comic Book Sample</strong></address><address>  *24 Interior Pages</address><address>  *Standard Size (6.625\" X 10.25\")</address><address>  *Thicker Cover (100# Gloss Cover Card Stock)</address><address>  *4 different types of Interior Paper within the pages (80# Gloss Text, 80# Silk Text, 70# Uncoated Text, 60# Uncoated Text)</address><address> </address><address><strong>&gt; Comic Cover Paper Sheet Sample 1</strong></address><address>   *Standard Size (6.625\" X 10.25\")</address><address>   *Standard Cover (80# Gloss Cover Card Stock)</address><address> </address><address><strong>&gt; Comic Cover Paper Sheet 2</strong></address><address>   *Standard Size (6.625 X 10.25\")</address><address>   *Thinner Cover (80# Gloss Text) </address><address> </address><address><strong>&gt; Comic Cover Paper Sheet 3</strong></address><address>   *Standard Size (6.625 X 10.25\")</address><address>   *Sketch Cover (80# Matte Uncoated Card Stock)</address><address> </address><address><strong>&gt; Flyer Paper Example </strong>(60# Uncoated Text)</address><address> </address><address><strong>&gt; Poster Paper Example </strong>(12 PT Gloss Coated Card Stock)</address><address> </address><address><strong>&gt; 2 Trading/Sketch Cards</strong></address><address>    * 16PT Coated</address><address>    * 130# Uncoated for Sketch</address><address>    * Two-Sided </address><address>  </address><address><strong>&gt; 1 Book Size Comparison Chart Guide</strong></address><address>   * 12 PT Gloss Coated Card Stock</address><address>   * Horizontally folded</address><address> </address><address><strong>&gt; 1 Sticker</strong></address>','Printing Comics Sample Pack Pre-Printed Materials','','draft','open','closed','','printing-comics-sample-pack-pre-printed-materials','','','2024-09-10 05:29:44','2024-09-10 05:29:44','',0,'https://mhc.lxf.temporary.site/website_b3635980/?post_type=product&#038;p=17782',0,'product','',0),(17783,2,'2024-08-28 11:15:38','2024-08-28 11:15:38','','IMG_3178-2__99424','','inherit','open','closed','','img_3178-2__99424','','','2024-08-28 11:15:38','2024-08-28 11:15:38','',17782,'https://mhc.lxf.temporary.site/website_b3635980/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/IMG_3178-2__99424.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(17784,2,'2024-08-28 11:15:56','2024-08-28 11:15:56','','IMG_3089__58181','','inherit','open','closed','','img_3089__58181','','','2024-08-28 11:15:56','2024-08-28 11:15:56','',17782,'https://mhc.lxf.temporary.site/website_b3635980/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/IMG_3089__58181.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(17785,2,'2024-08-28 11:15:57','2024-08-28 11:15:57','','IMG_3183-2__70629','','inherit','open','closed','','img_3183-2__70629','','','2024-08-28 11:15:57','2024-08-28 11:15:57','',17782,'https://mhc.lxf.temporary.site/website_b3635980/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/IMG_3183-2__70629.jpg',0,'a