untry_filter\":{\"action\":\"allow\",\"country_codes\":[],\"message\":\"Sorry, this form does not accept submissions from your country.\"},\"keyword_filter\":{\"message\":\"Sorry, your message can\'t be submitted because it contains prohibited words.\"}},\"form_tags\":[]},\"search_terms\":\"\",\"meta\":{\"template\":\"blank\"}}','Proof Approval/Changes','','inherit','closed','closed','','17867-revision-v1','','','2024-08-28 15:18:46','2024-08-28 15:18:46','',17867,'https://mhc.lxf.temporary.site/website_b3635980/?p=17879',0,'revision','',0),(17880,2,'2024-08-28 15:19:36','2024-08-28 15:19:36','<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h1>Fulfillment Services\n </h1>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"700\" height=\"350\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/fulfillment-services-photo-e1725956563474.jpg\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>Creators enjoy creating but fulfillment might not be so enjoyable. We come from an extensive background of shipping comics to be able to help with your fulfillment needs.</p><h3><strong>Multiple shipping addresses? No problem</strong></h3><p>We\'ll take care of splitting up the print order for you and packaging up where it needs to go. Coming straight from the printer is a good option for faster fulfillment services which spend less time in transit.</p><h4><strong>Follow these steps to take advantage of this option.</strong></h4>		\n													<img width=\"200\" height=\"209\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/step1-resized200x209.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>When you place your online print order, specify in the Notes section that you\'re interested in our fulfillment services. We will begin the printing process and send you our Fulfillment Spreadsheet for you to begin filling out your shipping information.</p>		\n													<img width=\"200\" height=\"209\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/step2-resized200x209.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>Before we start the shipping process, you\'ll have to finish submitting your shipping information to us and we will provide you with a shipping quote.</p>		\n													<img width=\"200\" height=\"209\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/step3-resized200x209.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>Once you\'ve had a chance to look over the quote, we\'ll send you a shipping invoice along with a confirmation of all of the shipping addresses. When you pay the invoice, we will move forward to shipping. The rest is on us so you can stay focused on creating!</p>		\n			<a href=\"/shop\">\n									ORDER MY COMICS\n					</a>','Fulfillment','','publish','closed','closed','','fulfillment','','','2024-09-10 08:35:01','2024-09-10 08:35:01','',0,'https://mhc.lxf.temporary.site/website_b3635980/?page_id=17880',0,'page','',0),(17882,2,'2024-08-28 15:23:20','2024-08-28 15:23:20','','fulfillment-main-image-2x','','inherit','open','closed','','fulfillment-main-image-2x','','','2024-08-28 15:23:20','2024-08-28 15:23:20','',17880,'https://mhc.lxf.temporary.site/website_b3635980/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/fulfillment-main-image-2x.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(17883,2,'2024-08-28 15:25:00','2024-08-28 15:25:00','','mask-group-285-2x','','inherit','open','closed','','mask-group-285-2x','','','2024-08-28 15:25:00','2024-08-28 15:25:00','',17880,'https://mhc.lxf.temporary.site/website_b3635980/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-285-2x.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(17884,2,'2024-08-28 15:27:38','2024-08-28 15:27:38','','mask-group-286-2x','','inherit','open','closed','','mask-group-286-2x','','','2024-08-28 15:27:38','2024-08-28 15:27:38','',17880,'https://mhc.lxf.temporary.site/website_b3635980/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-286-2x.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(17885,2,'2024-08-28 15:28:17','2024-08-28 15:28:17','','number-2-2x','','inherit','open','closed','','number-2-2x','','','2024-08-28 15:28:17','2024-08-28 15:28:17','',17880,'https://mhc.lxf.temporary.site/website_b3635980/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/number-2-2x.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(17886,2,'2024-08-28 15:29:43','2024-08-28 15:29:43','','number-3-2x','','inherit','open','closed','','number-3-2x','','','2024-08-28 15:29:43','2024-08-28 15:29:43','',17880,'https://mhc.lxf.temporary.site/website_b3635980/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/number-3-2x.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(17887,2,'2024-08-28 15:31:56','2024-08-28 15:31:56','','store-option','','inherit','open','closed','','store-option','','','2024-08-28 15:31:56','2024-08-28 15:31:56','',17880,'https://mhc.lxf.temporary.site/website_b3635980/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/store-option.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(17891,2,'2024-08-28 15:50:23','2024-08-28 15:50:23','','target','','inherit','open','closed','','target','','','2024-08-28 15:50:23','2024-08-28 15:50:23','',9462,'https://mhc.lxf.temporary.site/website_b3635980/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/target.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(17892,2,'2024-08-28 15:51:41','2024-08-28 15:51:41','','vision','','inherit','open','closed','','vision','','','2024-08-28 15:51:41','2024-08-28 15:51:41','',9462,'https://mhc.lxf.temporary.site/website_b3635980/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/vision.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(17893,2,'2024-08-28 15:52:05','2024-08-28 15:52:05','','values','','inherit','open','closed','','values','','','2024-08-28 15:52:05','2024-08-28 15:52:05','',9462,'https://mhc.lxf.temporary.site/website_b3635980/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/values.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(17894,2,'2024-08-28 15:52:38','2024-08-28 15:52:38','','customer-service','','inherit','open','closed','','customer-service','','','2024-08-28 15:52:38','2024-08-28 15:52:38','',9462,'https://mhc.lxf.temporary.site/website_b3635980/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/customer-service.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(17911,2,'2024-08-28 16:04:54','2024-08-28 16:04:54','<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h2>Who We Are</h2>		\n		<p>Printing Comics is a premier digital &amp; offset printing company located in Plymouth, Michigan, specializing in end-to-end Comic Book printing services. Founded in 2011 as a commercial and dedicated comic book printer, we print comic books for several individuals across the country and all over the world. Our primary goal is to delight our comic book publishers with the best printing experience accompanied by excellent and exceptional customer service.</p><p>Since our inception in the printing industry, we have evolved into a leading printer, printing comic books for over 7000 customers across the globe. Over the years we’ve remained privately-owned and operated by Anthony Grech; a renowned and passionate entrepreneur who’s ever committed to helping self-publishers make their dreams of having a top-notch and high-quality <strong>self publish comic book</strong> in their hand a reality.</p><p>Going by our passion for continuously bringing top-of-the-services to ensure that publishers find the best quality work that suits their needs, Anthony launched the company which has today become the heart of the printing industry offering its unique quality and unparalleled customer service at humanly affordable pricing. We take pride in our ability to meet all your <a href=\"https://www.grekoprinting-comixwellspring.com/standard-manga-and-magazine-sized-comics/\"><strong>custom comic book</strong></a> printing needs and completing your project correctly and on time under one roof!</p>		\n			<h2>What We Do</h2>		\n		<p>At Printing Comics, our specialty is comic book printing where we offer our broad spectrum of services ranging from Saddle Stitched Comic books, Square bound paperback books (Perfect Binding), Posters, Flyers, Retractable Banner Stands, Table Cloths, Vinyl Banners &amp; much more.</p><p>Whether you’re a self-publisher, <strong>graphic novel creator</strong>, Artist, or running a comic con, we are in business to deliver best in class printing using high-tech and state-of-the-art equipment in facilitating the most appealing designs and quality products carefully monitored with attention to detail.</p><p>We believe that quality work begins from understanding our customer’s need while tailoring our services to produce the result they envisioned. From the professional staff under our roof to our expert printing approaches, you will understand why top comic artists choose us and rate Comix Well Spring very high in the industry.</p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-content{width:100%}@media (min-width:768px){.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-left .elementor-image-box-wrapper,.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-right .elementor-image-box-wrapper{display:flex}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-right .elementor-image-box-wrapper{text-align:end;flex-direction:row-reverse}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-left .elementor-image-box-wrapper{text-align:start;flex-direction:row}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-position-top .elementor-image-box-img{margin:auto}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-vertical-align-top .elementor-image-box-wrapper{align-items:flex-start}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-vertical-align-middle .elementor-image-box-wrapper{align-items:center}.elementor-widget-image-box.elementor-vertical-align-bottom .elementor-image-box-wrapper{align-items:flex-end}}@media (max-width:767px){.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-img{margin-left:auto!important;margin-right:auto!important;margin-bottom:15px}}.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-img{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-title a{color:inherit}.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-wrapper{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image-box .elementor-image-box-description{margin:0}</style><figure><img width=\"59\" height=\"59\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/target.webp\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Our Mission</h3><p>At Printing Comics, it is our mission to retain standard at all levels from our product and service quality to customer’s satisfaction. We love and value our customers and aim to deliver our promise; premium comic books printing and unmatched customer’s service that is almost impossible to find anywhere even outside the industry.</p>		\n			<figure><img width=\"59\" height=\"59\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/vision.webp\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Our Vision</h3><p>To become a one-stop comic printing shop leveraging years of printing experience and expertise in meticulously delivering every project. We want to be globally recognized as one of a kind digital printing company - exceptional in its printing accuracy and precision.</p>		\n			<figure><img width=\"59\" height=\"59\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/values.webp\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Our Values</h3><p>Integrity, honesty, great quality, and swift turn around times. These are more than taglines for us: they are the key pillars holding our business right from its formation. We relate with every customer keeping these words as our guiding principles. Our ability to embody these values in everything that we do is what truly set us apart from others.</p>		\n			<figure><img width=\"59\" height=\"59\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/customer-service.webp\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Customer Service</h3><p>At the heart of Printing Comics is a commitment to continually foster a strong relationship with you, answering your queries concerning our services, and maintaining our core values, keeping current with changing trends, and competitors. Here, we don’t just meet your needs; we surpass them. Get in touch today and let\'s make your overall experience as enjoyable as possible!</p>		\n			<h2>We are professional</h2>		\n			<h2>We’re something other than duplicates…</h2>		\n			<h2>What’s more, we do it right!</h2>		\n			<h2>Printing organization mottos While the Internet might assume control of numerous parts of printing, a few things are as yet favored on paper. </h2>		\n                                <a  href=\"https://pricom.harutheme.com/service/services/\">\n                                                                </a>\n                                <h6>\n                                                