                                           <p>Pay with Multiple Credit Cards</p>','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','5060-revision-v1','','','2024-09-10 07:53:47','2024-09-10 07:53:47','',5060,'https://mhc.lxf.temporary.site/website_b3635980/?p=19669',0,'revision','',0),(19670,1,'2024-09-10 07:53:47','2024-09-10 07:53:47','<!--  -->\n			<h2>Printing Made Easier</h2>		\n	        		<h2>\n			For all your<br>Comic \n	    Book printing needs!\n  	  	</h2>\n			<h2>We provide the \n<b>\nHighest Quality Online Comic Book Printing Services</b></h2>		\n        		<a role=\"button\" href=\"/shop\">\n								Shop Now\n			    			</a>\n		https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XHOmBV4js_E		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"875\" height=\"794\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/top-banner-eclipse.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/top-banner-eclipse.png 875w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/top-banner-eclipse-300x272.png 300w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/top-banner-eclipse-768x697.png 768w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/top-banner-eclipse-600x544.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 875px) 100vw, 875px\" />													\n													<img width=\"1040\" height=\"790\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/top-banner-1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/top-banner-1.png 1040w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/top-banner-1-300x228.png 300w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/top-banner-1-1024x778.png 1024w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/top-banner-1-768x583.png 768w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/top-banner-1-600x456.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1040px) 100vw, 1040px\" />													\n			<h2>We are Comic book people</h2>		\n			<h2>We’re not community advocates, we\'re just a printer…</h2>		\n			<h2>What’s more, we do it right!</h2>		\n			<h2>We are a censorship free printer that will not engage in online cancelation battles.<br>No one will have any ability to influence your projects development with us.</h2>		\n													<img src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/no-minimum-orders-2-qtavfenkppz9fv36i6kpxipst1lj2ak48jbqd9ehxy.png\" title=\"no minimum orders\" alt=\"no minimum orders\" loading=\"lazy\" />													\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h2>Say goodbye to order minimums!</h2>		\n		<p>We\'re absolutely fed up with the ridiculous order minimums that force you to buy more than you need, and we know you are too! It feels like you\'re being unfairly squeezed, paying for extra products you don’t even want. At our company, we reject this exploitative practice. We offer the same great prices regardless of how much you order because we value our customers and don’t want to penalize you for your needs. We\'re committed to treating you with fairness and respect, not trying to profit from unnecessary requirements.</p>		\n                                <a  href=\"https://pricom.harutheme.com/service/services/\">\n                                                                </a>\n                                <h6>\n                                                                            <a href=\"https://pricom.harutheme.com/service/services/\" >\n                                                                            Printing Services                                                                            </a>\n                                                                    </h6>\n                                                                <p>Fast comic book printing.  Foils, Metals, Glow-in-the-dark, Graphic Novels, 3D prints?  Oh my!</p>\n                                <a  href=\"https://pricom.harutheme.com/service/services/\">\n                                                                </a>\n                                <h6>\n                                                                            <a href=\"https://pricom.harutheme.com/service/services/\" >\n                                                                            Damage Free Shipping                                                                            </a>\n                                                                    </h6>\n                                                                <p>Tired of getting damaged books?  Well maybe it\'s time you let comic book people handle your books and not print operators.</p>\n                                <a  href=\"https://pricom.harutheme.com/service/services/\">\n                                                                </a>\n                                <h6>\n                                                                            <a href=\"https://pricom.harutheme.com/service/services/\" >\n                                                                            Design Services                                                                            </a>\n                                                                    </h6>\n                                                                <p>Need help with file layouts?  We got you.</p>\n                                <a  href=\"https://pricom.harutheme.com/service/services/\">\n                                                                </a>\n                                <h6>\n                                                                            <a href=\"https://pricom.harutheme.com/service/services/\" >\n                                                                            3D Printing                                                                            </a>\n                                                                    </h6>\n                                                                <p>Want to start selling statues on your next campaign?  Well, we can make that happen!</p>\n			<h2>Add Your Heading Text Here</h2>		\n													<img width=\"1081\" height=\"889\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/ellipse-banner-3.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/ellipse-banner-3.png 1081w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/ellipse-banner-3-300x247.png 300w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/ellipse-banner-3-1024x842.png 1024w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/ellipse-banner-3-768x632.png 768w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/ellipse-banner-3-600x493.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" />													\n			<a href=\"https://pricom.harutheme.com/service/shop/\" >\n				<img src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/banner-1-1-1-e1724897405438.png\" alt=\"Printing Comics\">\n			</a>\n			<a href=\"https://pricom.harutheme.com/service/product-category/books/\" >\n				<img src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/banner-1-2.png\" alt=\"Printing Comics\">\n			</a>\n			<h2>Fast, Easy and Affordable</h2>		\n			<h2>Welcome to PRINTING COMICS</h2>		\n			<h2>Specializing in printing comic books for the independent comic book creator.</h2>		\n	        			<ul>\n			<li>\n		          	Affordable prices\n      	</li>\n			<li>\n		          	Shorter wait times\n      	</li>\n			<li>\n		          	Handled with care\n      	</li>\n			<li>\n		          	Packaged right\n      	</li>\n		</ul>\n			<h2>Featured Products</h2>		\n		<h4>We don’t just deliver your product, we also deliver peace of mind</h4>		\n        <ul data-slick=\'{\"slidesToShow\" : 3, \"slidesToScroll\" : 1, \"arrows\" : true, \"infinite\" : false, \"centerMode\" : false, \"focusOnSelect\" : true, \"vertical\" : false, \"autoplay\": false, \"autoplaySpeed\": 3000, \"responsive\" : [{\"breakpoint\" : 1575,\"settings\" : {\"dots\": true, \"arrows\": false}}, {\"breakpoint\" : 991,\"settings\" : {\"slidesToShow\" : 2, \"slidesToScroll\" : 1, \"dots\": true, \"arrows\": false}}, {\"breakpoint\" : 767,\"settings\" : {\"slidesToShow\" : 1, \"slidesToScroll\" : 1, \"dots\": true, \"arrows\": false}}] }\'>\n                                    <li>\n                    <!--  -->\n                <a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/product/comics-saddle-stitch-staple-binding/\">\n<img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Screenshot-2024-09-10-002704-300x300.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Screenshot-2024-09-10-002704-300x300.png 300w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Screenshot-2024-09-10-002704-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a>            \n            <!-- ADD TO WISHLIST -->\n	<a href=\"?add_to_wishlist=57\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-product-id=\"57\" data-product-type=\"simple\" data-original-product-id=\"57\" data-title=\"Add to wishlist\">\n		Add to wishlist\n				Add to wishlist\n	</a>\n            <!-- COUNT TEXT -->\n                            <a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/product/comics-saddle-stitch-staple-binding/\">\n                                Select options\n                            </a>\n	<a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-admin/admin-ajax.php?ajax=true&#038;action=load_quickview_content&#038;product_id=57\">Quick view</a>            \n            <a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/product/comics-saddle-stitch-staple-binding/\"><h2>Comics &#8211; Saddle stitch (staple binding)</h2></a>\n	<bdi>&#36;3.55</bdi>\n        <p>For reprints/reorders of comic books over four months old, sending us a physical copy of the previous version helps ensure color consistency. Please reach out to customer service (sales@printingcomics.com) if you have questions regarding shipping costs for this process. We DO NOT keep files on hand for more than 12 months. If you have not placed an order in over 12 months, you must share your files with us.</p>\n                            <a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/product/comics-saddle-stitch-staple-binding/\">\n                                Select options\n                            </a>\n            <!-- ADD TO WISHLIST -->\n	<a href=\"?add_to_wishlist=57\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-product-id=\"57\" data-product-type=\"simple\" data-original-product-id=\"57\" data-title=\"Add to wishlist\">\n		Add to wishlist\n				Add to wishlist\n	</a>\n            <!-- COUNT TEXT -->\n            <!--  -->\n                    </li>\n                                  <li>\n                    <!--  -->\n                <a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/product/novels-square-bound-paperbacks-glue-binding/\">\n<img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Screenshot-2024-09-10-002910-300x300.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Screenshot-2024-09-10-002910-300x300.png 300w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Screenshot-2024-09-10-002910-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a>            \n            <!-- ADD TO WISHLIST -->\n	<a href=\"?add_to_wishlist=64\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-product-id=\"64\" data-product-type=\"simple\" data-original-product-id=\"64\" data-title=\"Add to wishlist\">\n		Add to wishlist\n				Add to wishlist\n	</a>\n            <!-- COUNT TEXT -->\n                            <a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/product/novels-square-bound-paperbacks-glue-binding/\">\n                                Select options\n                            </a>\n	<a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-admin/admin-ajax.php?ajax=true&#038;action=load_quickview_content&#038;product_id=64\">Quick view</a>            \n            <a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/product/novels-square-bound-paperbacks-glue-binding/\"><h2>Novels &#8211; Square Bound Paperbacks (Glue Binding)</h2></a>\n	<bdi>&#36;6.80</bdi>\n        <p>Perfect bound (glue binding) &#8211; square Interior page counts from 20-300 (*If page count exceeds 300 email for quote) NO minimum quantity print Rush delivery is available Price Breaks with higher quantities Wide variety of cover &amp; interiors paper options Full color OR Black &amp; White (includes grayscale) Printing templates available! Printing Comics AD insert discount option Foil cover instructions *Spine width formula: Use our new Printing Comics spine width calculator here! Reordering Note: For reprints/reorders of comic books over four months old, sending us a physical copy of the previous version helps ensure color consistency. Please reach out to customer service [&hellip;]</p>\n                            <a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/product/novels-square-bound-paperbacks-glue-binding/\">\n                                Select options\n                            </a>\n            <!-- ADD TO WISHLIST -->\n	<a href=\"?add_to_wi