qs.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/banner-faqs.png 498w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/banner-faqs-300x211.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 498px) 100vw, 498px\" />													\n			<h2>Any Questions</h2>		\n	<ul>\n					<li>\n					<h6>Phone</h6>\n					<strong>1800 9284 9999</strong>\n			</li>\n					<li>\n					<h6>Email</h6>\n					hello@printingcomics.com\n			</li>\n			</ul>\n                          <!--   \n                                     -->\n                                                                <a href=\"\">How long is your turnaround time?</a>\n                            <p>14 days or sooner from the time you place the order.</p>\n                                                                <a href=\"\">Do you offer physical proofs?</a>\n                            <p>Yes, we offer both physical and digital proofs.</p>\n                                                                <a href=\"\">What sort of other services do you offer besides comic book printing?</a>\n                            <p>Laser engraving, 3d printing, sticker printing, custom t-shirts, and more. Please contact us to tell us what you&#8217;re interested in.</p>\n                                                                <a href=\"\">What files do I need?</a>\n                            <p>Submit your comic book files in at least 300 DPI in CYMK, flattened (no layers), and in either JPG, PNG, and PDF. Please make sure everything is sized appropriately. You can take advantage of our free template in Info &gt; Specs &amp; Templates.</p>\n                                                                <a href=\"\">Do you offer comic book mailers?</a>\n                            <p>This is a service we are currently working on and will be available soon.</p>','FAQs','','inherit','closed','closed','','15651-revision-v1','','','2024-09-10 07:59:47','2024-09-10 07:59:47','',15651,'https://mhc.lxf.tem