quare Bound Paperbacks (Glue Binding)</h2></a>\n	<bdi>&#36;6.80</bdi>\n        <p>Perfect bound (glue binding) &#8211; square Interior page counts from 20-300 (*If page count exceeds 300 email for quote) NO minimum quantity print Rush delivery is available Price Breaks with higher quantities Wide variety of cover &amp; interiors paper options Full color OR Black &amp; White (includes grayscale) Printing templates available! Printing Comics AD insert discount option Foil cover instructions *Spine width formula: Use our new Printing Comics spine width calculator here! Reordering Note: For reprints/reorders of comic books over four months old, sending us a physical copy of the previous version helps ensure color consistency. Please reach out to customer service [&hellip;]</p>\n                            <a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/product/novels-square-bound-paperbacks-glue-binding/\">\n                                Select options\n                            </a>\n            <!-- ADD TO WISHLIST -->\n	<a href=\"?add_to_wishlist=64\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-product-id=\"64\" data-product-type=\"simple\" data-original-product-id=\"64\" data-title=\"Add to wishlist\">\n		Add to wishlist\n				Add to wishlist\n	</a>\n            <!-- COUNT TEXT -->\n            <!--  -->\n                    </li>\n                                  <li>\n                    <!--  -->\n                <a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/product/comics-saddle-stitch-staple-binding/\">\n<img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Screenshot-2024-09-10-002704-300x300.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Screenshot-2024-09-10-002704-300x300.png 300w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Screenshot-2024-09-10-002704-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a>            \n            <!-- ADD TO WISHLIST -->\n	<a href=\"?add_to_wishlist=57\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-product-id=\"57\" data-product-type=\"simple\" data-original-product-id=\"57\" data-title=\"Add to wishlist\">\n		Add to wishlist\n				Add to wishlist\n	</a>\n            <!-- COUNT TEXT -->\n                            <a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/product/comics-saddle-stitch-staple-binding/\">\n                                Select options\n                            </a>\n	<a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-admin/admin-ajax.php?ajax=true&#038;action=load_quickview_content&#038;product_id=57\">Quick view</a>            \n            <a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/product/comics-saddle-stitch-staple-binding/\"><h2>Comics &#8211; Saddle stitch (staple binding)</h2></a>\n	<bdi>&#36;3.55</bdi>\n        <p>For reprints/reorders of comic books over four months old, sending us a physical copy of the previous version helps ensure color consistency. Please reach out to customer service (sales@printingcomics.com) if you have questions regarding shipping costs for this process. We DO NOT keep files on hand for more than 12 months. If you have not placed an order in over 12 months, you must share your files with us.</p>\n                            <a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/product/comics-saddle-stitch-staple-binding/\">\n                                Select options\n                            </a>\n            <!-- ADD TO WISHLIST -->\n	<a href=\"?add_to_wishlist=57\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-product-id=\"57\" data-product-type=\"simple\" data-original-product-id=\"57\" data-title=\"Add to wishlist\">\n		Add to wishlist\n				Add to wishlist\n	</a>\n            <!-- COUNT TEXT -->\n            <!--  -->\n                    </li>\n                  </ul>\n													<img width=\"540\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/funded-stamp__540x320.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/funded-stamp__540x320.png 540w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/funded-stamp__540x320-300x178.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 540px) 100vw, 540px\" />													\n		<p>Interested in our fulfillment services?</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/fulfillment/\">\n									Learn more\n					</a>','Crowdfunding','','inherit','closed','closed','','17814-revision-v1','','','2024-09-10 08:19:34','2024-09-10 08:19:34','',17814,'https://mhc.lxf.temporary.site/website_b3635980/?p=19685',0,'revision','',0),(19686,1,'2024-09-10 08:19:34','2024-09-10 08:19:34','<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"3000\" height=\"600\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Fully-Funded-on-FMC-2.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Fully-Funded-on-FMC-2.png 3000w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Fully-Funded-on-FMC-2-300x60.png 300w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Fully-Funded-on-FMC-2-1024x205.png 1024w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Fully-Funded-on-FMC-2-768x154.png 768w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Fully-Funded-on-FMC-2-1536x307.png 1536w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Fully-Funded-on-FMC-2-2048x410.png 2048w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Fully-Funded-on-FMC-2-600x120.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 3000px) 100vw, 3000px\" />													\n		<p>We\'re excited to announce a special offer with FundMyComic, a platform designed with creators in mind. When you launch your next ambitious crowdfunding campaign through FundMyComic, you\'ll receive an additional 5% off our crowdfunding print discount. Please note that all existing rules still apply. Make sure to review the entire page for complete details.</p><h4> </h4>		\n													<img width=\"877\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/360_F_379477595_JQaA74y7doeMlDizc5nGBekTMf23P9jY.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/360_F_379477595_JQaA74y7doeMlDizc5nGBekTMf23P9jY.jpg 877w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/360_F_379477595_JQaA74y7doeMlDizc5nGBekTMf23P9jY-300x123.jpg 300w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/360_F_379477595_JQaA74y7doeMlDizc5nGBekTMf23P9jY-768x315.jpg 768w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/360_F_379477595_JQaA74y7doeMlDizc5nGBekTMf23P9jY-600x246.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 877px) 100vw, 877px\" />													\n		<p><strong><em>* Follow these rules to receive our Crowdfunding discount. </em></strong></p><h4><strong>Discount will NOT be applied AFTER the campaign.</strong></h4><p>To be eligible for this program, you must be in contact with us prior to launching your crowdfunding campaign.</p><h4><strong>You will receive one discount code for your print order.</strong></h4><p>Whether you run campaigns on multiple platforms or just one campaign, your one discount code applies to your print order. It cannot be combined with other discount codes.</p><h4><strong>Discount code expires in 60 days or less. </strong></h4><p>Get started below. </p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-divider{--divider-border-style:none;--divider-border-width:1px;--divider-color:#0c0d0e;--divider-icon-size:20px;--divider-element-spacing:10px;--divider-pattern-height:24px;--divider-pattern-size:20px;--divider-pattern-url:none;--divider-pattern-repeat:repeat-x}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider{display:flex}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider__text{font-size:15px;line-height:1;max-width:95%}.elementor-widget-divider .elementor-divider__element{margin:0 var(--divider-element-spacing);flex-shrink:0