ding/\">\n                                Select options\n                            </a>\n            <!-- ADD TO WISHLIST -->\n	<a href=\"?add_to_wishlist=64\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-product-id=\"64\" data-product-type=\"simple\" data-original-product-id=\"64\" data-title=\"Add to wishlist\">\n		Add to wishlist\n				Add to wishlist\n	</a>\n            <!-- COUNT TEXT -->\n            <!--  -->\n                    </li>\n                                  <li>\n                    <!--  -->\n                <a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/product/comics-saddle-stitch-staple-binding/\">\n<img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Screenshot-2024-09-10-002704-300x300.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Screenshot-2024-09-10-002704-300x300.png 300w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/Screenshot-2024-09-10-002704-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a>            \n            <!-- ADD TO WISHLIST -->\n	<a href=\"?add_to_wishlist=57\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-product-id=\"57\" data-product-type=\"simple\" data-original-product-id=\"57\" data-title=\"Add to wishlist\">\n		Add to wishlist\n				Add to wishlist\n	</a>\n            <!-- COUNT TEXT -->\n                            <a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/product/comics-saddle-stitch-staple-binding/\">\n                                Select options\n                            </a>\n	<a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-admin/admin-ajax.php?ajax=true&#038;action=load_quickview_content&#038;product_id=57\">Quick view</a>            \n            <a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/product/comics-saddle-stitch-staple-binding/\"><h2>Comics &#8211; Saddle stitch (staple binding)</h2></a>\n	<bdi>&#36;3.55</bdi>\n        <p>For reprints/reorders of comic books over four months old, sending us a physical copy of the previous version helps ensure color consistency. Please reach out to customer service (sales@printingcomics.com) if you have questions regarding shipping costs for this process. We DO NOT keep files on hand for more than 12 months. If you have not placed an order in over 12 months, you must share your files with us.</p>\n                            <a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/product/comics-saddle-stitch-staple-binding/\">\n                                Select options\n                            </a>\n            <!-- ADD TO WISHLIST -->\n	<a href=\"?add_to_wishlist=57\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-product-id=\"57\" data-product-type=\"simple\" data-original-product-id=\"57\" data-title=\"Add to wishlist\">\n		Add to wishlist\n				Add to wishlist\n	</a>\n            <!-- COUNT TEXT -->\n            <!--  -->\n                    </li>\n                  </ul>\n													<img width=\"216\" height=\"233\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/fulfillment-services.png\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>Interested in our fulfillment services?</p>		\n			<a href=\"https://printingcomics.com/fulfillment/\">\n									Learn more\n					</a>','Crowdfunding','','inherit','closed','closed','','17814-revision-v1','','','2024-09-10 08:19:34','2024-09-10 08:19:34','',17814,'https://mhc.lxf.temporary.site/website_b3635980/?p=19686',0,'revision','',0),(19687,1,'2024-09-10 08:22:00','2024-09-10 08:22:00','','fulfillment services photo','','inherit','open','closed','','fulfillment-services-photo','','','2024-09-10 08:22:00','2024-09-10 08:22:00','',17880,'https://mhc.lxf.temporary.site/website_b3635980/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/fulfillment-services-photo.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(19692,1,'2024-09-10 08:23:58','2024-09-10 08:23:58','<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"700\" height=\"350\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/fulfillment-services-photo-e1725956563474.jpg\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>To help you focus more on doing what you do best -- creating -- we want to help carry the heavy load and laborious process of fulfillment.</p><p>Here are two dynamic fulfillment options we offer, and WILL offer in the near future!</p>		\n													<img width=\"1024\" height=\"357\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-285-2x-1024x357.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-285-2x-1024x357.webp 1024w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-285-2x-300x104.webp 300w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-285-2x-768x267.webp 768w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-285-2x-1536x535.webp 1536w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-285-2x-600x209.webp 600w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-285-2x.webp 1832w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />													\n		<h3><strong>Multiple shipping addresses (Shipping Fulfillment only)</strong></h3><p> If you need your printed books shipped to multiple destinations but don\'t need us to store them in our warehouse, then this is the fulfillment option you need! Say goodbye to the daunting pile of shipping labels and extra step in getting your comics to their final destination. </p><h4><strong>Here\'s how to take advantage of this option.</strong></h4>		\n													<img width=\"1832\" height=\"238\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-286-2x.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-286-2x.webp 1832w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-286-2x-300x39.webp 300w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-286-2x-1024x133.webp 1024w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-286-2x-768x100.webp 768w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-286-2x-1536x200.webp 1536w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-286-2x-600x78.webp 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1832px) 100vw, 1832px\" />													\n		<p>Once you confirm your print order (you\'ll be able to choose this option at the shipping options step during checkout), we\'ll send you a confirmation email that will contain further instructions for shipping. If you don\'t see the confirmation email, please check your spam folder! Since you paid for the printing portion, we will begin the printing process for your order.</p>		\n													<img width=\"1832\" height=\"238\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/number-2-2x.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/number-2-2x.webp 1832w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/number-2-2x-300x39.webp 300w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/number-2-2x-1024x133.webp 1024w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/number-2-2x-768x100.webp 768w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/number-2-2x-1536x200.webp 1536w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/number-2-2x-600x78.webp 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1832px) 100vw, 1832px\" />													\n		<p>You\'ll need to submit a shipping list to us, and we\'ll send you a shipping quote in return before we start the shipping process. We will require you to send your shipping list in an excel file following this <a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">excel template</a> (you must follow this format). Please email this excel list to <strong>sales@printingcomics.com</strong> with the printing order number that you received in the confirmation email.</p>		\n													<img width=\"1832\" height=\"238\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/number-3-2x.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/number-3-2x.webp 1832w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/number-3-2x-300x39.webp 300w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/number-3-2x-1024x133.webp 1024w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/number-3-2x-768x100.webp 768w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/number-3-2x-1536x200.webp 1536w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/number-3-2x-600x78.webp 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1832px) 100vw, 1832px\" />													\n		<p>Finally, we will then email you back with an invoice to ship to all of the locations on the submitted list. And if you decide to move forward, we will email you a payment link to begin the shipping process.</p>		\n			<a href=\"/shop\">\n									ORDER MY COMICS\n					</a>\n													<img width=\"1832\" height=\"1038\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/store-option.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/store-option.webp 1832w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/store-option-300x170.webp 300w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/store-option-1024x580.webp 1024w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/store-option-768x435.webp 768w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/store-option-1536x870.webp 1536w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/store-option-600x340.webp 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1832px) 100vw, 1832px\" />													\n		<p><strong>If you want to start selling your book on the digital store without the hassle of storing, packaging, and shipping your printed books, then the CWS Bookstore subscription is what you need!</strong></p>','Fulfillment','','inherit','closed','closed','','17880-revision-v1','','','2024-09-10 08:23:58','2024-09-10 08:23:58','',17880,'https://mhc.lxf.temporary.site/website_b3635980/?p=19692',0,'revision','',0),(19693,1,'2024-09-10 08:23:59','2024-09-10 08:23:59','<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h1>Fulfillment Services\n </h1>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width=\"700\" height=\"350\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/fulfillment-services-photo-e1725956563474.jpg\" alt=\"\" />													\n		<p>To help you focus more on doing what you do best -- creating -- we want to help carry the heavy load and laborious process of fulfillment.</p><p>Here are two dynamic fulfillment options we offer, and WILL offer in the near future!</p>		\n													<img width=\"1024\" height=\"357\" src=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-285-2x-1024x357.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-285-2x-1024x357.webp 1024w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-285-2x-300x104.webp 300w, https://printingcomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/mask-group-285-2x-768x267.webp 768w, h